    "body": "## Summary\n- add Flyway V24 for private job reports with structured reasons, moderation status and uniqueness per reporter/job\n- add authenticated `POST /job-reports/jobs/{jobId}` and `GET /job-reports/mine`\n- reject self-reporting and duplicate reports in the service layer, with matching database constraints\n- keep reports private and separate from discovery, job details, notifications and location/tracking APIs\n- add unit coverage and trust/safety documentation\n\n## Safety / privacy\n- reports are never public and do not expose other reporters\n- a single report does not automatically hide a job or punish a user\n- optional details are capped at 1000 characters\n- moderation states are auditable and ready for a later admin workflow\n\n## Validation\nRun Maven verify, Flyway/PostgreSQL/runtime smoke, frontend lint/build and existing payment/runtime gates. Do not merge unless required checks are green.",
